orning. Here’s what needs your attention.</p></div><span class="hidden rounded-control border border-border-muted bg-surface px-3 py-1.5 text-[11px] text-ink-secondary sm:inline">Practice overview</span></div><div class="grid gap-4 p-4 lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1.45fr)_minmax(250px,.72fr)] lg:p-5"><section class="min-w-0"><div class="flex items-center justify-between"><p class="text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-ink-muted">Schedule &amp; continuity</p><span class="text-[11px] text-ink-muted">3 appointments</span></div><div class="mt-2 overflow-hidden rounded-control border border-border-muted bg-surface"><div class="grid grid-cols-[58px_minmax(0,1fr)_auto] items-center gap-3 border-b border-border-muted px-3 py-2.5"><p class="text-xs font-semibold">09:00</p><div><p class="text-xs font-semibold">Client A</p><p class="text-[11px] text-ink-muted">Context reviewed · session complete</p></div><span class="text-[10px] font-semibold text-success">Follow-through</span></div><div class="grid grid-cols-[58px_minmax(0,1fr)_auto] items-center gap-3 border-b border-border-muted bg-state-selected px-3 py-2.5"><p class="text-xs font-semibold">11:30</p><div><p class="text-xs font-semibold">Client B</p><p class="text-[11px] text-ink-muted">Previous session and current focus ready</p></div><span class="rounded-control bg-action-primary px-2 py-1 text-[10px] font-semibold text-on-action">Prepare</span></div><div class="grid grid-cols-[58px_minmax(0,1fr)_auto] items-center gap-3 px-3 py-2.5"><p class="text-xs font-semibold">15:00</p><div><p class="text-xs font-semibold">Client C</p><p class="text-[11px] text-ink-muted">Zoom appointment</p></div><span class="text-[10px] text-ink-muted">Later</span></div></div><div class="mt-4 grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-2"><article class="rounded-control border border-border-muted bg-surface p-3"><p class="text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-ink-muted">Client B · continuity</p><p class="mt-2 text-sm font-semibold"