    <section id="platform" class="scroll-mt-6 border-b border-border-muted bg-surface-raised"><div class="mx-auto grid w-full max-w-[1540px] px-5 sm:grid-cols-2 sm:px-8 lg:grid-cols-4 xl:px-12"><div class="border-b border-border-muted py-5 sm:border-r lg:border-b-0 lg:pr-6"><p class="type-eyebrow text-ink-muted">One working context</p><p class="mt-2 text-sm text-ink-secondary">Today, clients, sessions, transcripts and documents stay connected instead of becoming separate admin silos.</p></div><div class="border-b border-border-muted py-5 sm:pl-6 lg:border-b-0 lg:border-r lg:pr-6"><p class="type-eyebrow text-ink-muted">Clinical continuity</p><p class="mt-2 text-sm text-ink-secondary">See the relevant thread before, during and after a session without relying on memory alone.</p></div><div class="border-b border-border-muted py-5 sm:border-b-0 sm:border-r lg:pl-6 lg:pr-6"><p class="type-eyebrow text-ink-muted">Deliberate records</p><p class="mt-2 text-sm text-ink-secondary">Working drafts remain editable. Clinical Records are approved deliberately and kept distinct.</p></div><div class="py-5 sm:pl-6"><p class="type-eyebrow text-ink-muted">Therapist-controlled AI</p><p class="mt-2 text-sm text-ink-secondary">Contextual assistance supports the work; therapist judgement remains authoritative.</p></div></div></section>

    <section class="mx-auto w-full max-w-[1200px] px-5 py-16 sm:px-8 lg:py-20"><div class="grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[.72fr_1.28fr] lg:gap-16"><div><p class="type-eyebrow text-action-link">The work around therapy</p><h2 class="mt-3 text-3xl font-semibold tracking-[-0.03em] sm:text-4xl">Continuity across the whole professional day.</h2><p class="mt-4 type-body-long text-ink-secondary">Helios is built around the sequence of real therapist work, not around a single note or AI interaction.</p></div><div class="grid gap-px overflow-hidden rounded-panel border border-border bg-border sm:grid-cols-2"><article class="bg-surface-raised p-6"><p class="type-eyebrow text-ink-muted">01 · Prepare</p><h3 class="mt-2 type-subsection">Today and client context</h3><p class="mt-3 type-body text-ink-secondary">Bring appointments, recent work and follow-through into view before the next session.</p></article><article class="bg-surface-raised p-6"><p class="type-eyebrow text-ink-muted">02 · Work</p><h3 class="mt-2 type-subsection">Sessions and transcripts</h3><p class="mt-3 type-body text-ink-secondary">Bring transcript material into the same protected workflow whether it arrives through supported Zoom capture or a transcript you import yourself.</p></article><article class="bg-surface-raised p-6"><p class="type-eyebrow text-ink-muted">03 · Decide</p><h3 class="mt-2 type-subsection">Clinical Records</h3><p class="mt-3 type-body text-ink-secondary">Review what belongs in the formal record and approve it deliberately rather than treating drafts as records.</p></article><article class="bg-surface-raised p-6"><p class="type-eyebrow text-ink-muted">04 · Continue</p><h3 class="mt-2 type-subsection">Follow-through and CPD</h3><p class="mt-3 type-body text-ink-secondary">Carry professional threads forward, including learning and development beyond individual client work.</p></article></div></div></section>

    <section id="continuity" class="scroll-mt-6 border-y border-border-muted bg-surface-elevated"><div class="mx-auto grid w-full max-w-[1200px] gap-10 px-5 py-16 sm:px-8 lg:grid-cols-[.8fr_1.2fr] lg:items-center lg:py-20"><div><p class="type-eyebrow text-action-link">Continuity engine</p><h2 class="mt-3 text-3xl font-semibold tracking-[-0.03em] sm:text-4xl">The workspace becomes more useful as the work develops.</h2><p class="mt-4 type-body-long text-ink-secondary">Helios can help surface possible patterns across therapist-approved sessions, giving you a longitudinal view without turning provisional observations into clinical fact.</p><p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-6 text-ink-muted">Continuity works from approved material rather than raw transcripts. It does not diagnose, assess risk, recommend treatment or replace therapist judgement.</p></div><div class="overflow-hidden rounded-panel border border-border bg-surface-raised"><div class="border-b border-border-muted p-5"><div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4"><div><p class="type-eyebrow text-ink-muted">Longitudinal review</p><h3 class="mt-1 type-subsection">Possible patterns to review</h3></div><span class="rounded-control bg-brand-sage-soft px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-semibold text-action-link">AI-supported · provisional</span></div></div><div class="grid gap-px bg-border sm:grid-cols-3"><div class="bg-surface-raised p-5"><p class="text-xs font-semibold">Approved session</p><p class="mt-2 text-xs leading-5 text-ink-muted">Therapist-approved material enters the longitudinal view.</p></div><div class="bg-surface-raised p-5"><p class="text-xs font-semibold">Across time</p><p class="mt-2 text-xs leading-5 text-ink-muted">Possible recurring threads can be surfaced for consideration.</p></div><div class="bg-surface-raised p-5"><p class="text-xs font-semibold">Therapist review</p><p class="mt-2 text-xs leading-5 text-ink-muted">Observations remain provisional and outside the Clinical Record unless you decide otherwise.</p></div></div></div></div></section>

    <section id="capture" class="mx-auto w-full max-w-[1200px] px-5 py-16 sm:px-8 lg:py-20"><div class="grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[.85fr_1.15fr] lg:items-center"><div><p class="type-eyebrow text-action-link">Capture where therapy happens</p><h2 class="mt-3 text-3xl font-semibold tracking-[-0.03em] sm:text-4xl">The session does not have to happen inside Helios.</h2><p class="mt-4 type-body-long text-ink-secondary">Use supported Zoom transcript capture, or bring in a .vtt/.txt transcript or pasted transcript text from another setting. Helios routes it into the same protected transcript inbox so you can assign it deliberately to the right client and session.</p></div><div class="grid gap-3"><div class="grid grid-cols-[110px_minmax(0,1fr)] items-center rounded-control border border-border-muted bg-surface-raised p-4"><p class="text-sm font-semibold">Zoom</p><p class="text-sm text-ink-secondary">Supported meeting and My Notes transcript workflows feed into Helios.</p></div><div class="grid grid-cols-[110px_minmax(0,1fr)] items-center rounded-control border border-border-muted bg-surface-raised p-4"><p class="text-sm font-semibold">Other settings</p><p class="text-sm text-ink-secondary">Export transcript text from the service you use, then import or paste it into Helios.</p></div><div class="grid grid-cols-[110px_minmax(0,1fr)] items-center rounded-control border border-border-muted bg-state-selected p-4"><p class="text-sm font-semibold">Transcript Inbox</p><p class="text-sm text-ink-secondary">Review and assign captured material before it joins the client’s working context.</p></div></div></div></section>

